@startuml Get Presenter Types

participant "Calling Service" as Web
participant "Presenters API" as PresentersAPI
participant "Exempt Users\n Collection" as ExemptUsersCollection
participant "ACSP Manage\n Users API" as ACSPAPI
box "Statement Matrix" #LightBlue
    participant "Form Group\n to Form" as FormGroupToForm
    participant "Form Group\n to Presenter Type" as FormGroupToPresenterType
end box

Web -> PresentersAPI: Get presenter types
PresentersAPI -> FormGroupToForm: Get Form Group for Form
PresentersAPI -> FormGroupToPresenterType: Get Presenter Type for Form Group
PresentersAPI -> ExemptUsersCollection: Check if user is exempt
PresentersAPI -> ACSPAPI: Check if user is associated with ACSP
PresentersAPI -> Web: Return presenter types

@enduml

